{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/943up8rm","slideIndex":8,"position":{"left":355,"top":375,"width":848,"height":96},"text":"Q = ∫I dt,  n(H₂) = Q/(2F),  n(O₂) = Q/(4F)\nF ≈ 96,485 C/mol, 수소와 산소의 몰수 비는 2 : 1이다.","geometry":"rect","lineWidth":0,"style":{"fontSize":26,"typeface":"Apple SD Gothic Neo","color":"#163C3E","alignment":"left"}}
